{
  "name": "Trade show booth leads: upload the scans, check every email and start the follow-up",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Trade show booth leads: upload the scans, check every email and start the follow-up\n\n### How it works\nBadge scans are full of typos and personal addresses. After the event, open the form, type the event name and upload the CSV (columns email, first_name, last_name, company, title). Up to max_rows rows are read. Argorant checks every email; valid ones without a title are enriched to fill it, and each joins your post-event campaign with {{event_name}} as a variable, so the first email can mention the booth conversation. The form ends with the number of people added.\n\nCosts: half a credit per fresh check, 1 credit per enrichment that finds the person. Your own contacts join for free.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Pick the campaign in **Add to the post-event campaign** and set max_rows in **Settings**.\n4. Activate and open the production URL of **Upload booth scans**.\n\n### Customization\nSkip the enrichment step if your scans already carry titles.",
        "height": 636,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "1fc4285a-ef8f-47ea-b0b5-601895c96680",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
